@startuml
[*] --> UserRegistration : [new user]
UserRegistration --> RegistrationSuccess : successful registration
RegistrationSuccess --> Login : after registration, proceed to login
Login --> LoginSuccess : successful login
LoginSuccess --> FacilityAccess : access facilities after login
FacilityAccess --> NewsReading : read news or expert content
NewsReading --> HealthInfo : check symptoms or fitness options
HealthInfo --> ContinueUsing : continue using the system
ContinueUsing --> ViewResult : view results
ViewResult --> PaymentProcess : process payment for services
PaymentProcess --> InsuranceValidation : validate insurance
InsuranceValidation --> PaymentComplete : complete payment
PaymentComplete --> FeedbackCollection : collect user feedback
FeedbackCollection --> Logout : log out at the end of session
Logout --> [*] : exit system
@enduml
